        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, PV, at 3.5 MWp open ground, multi-Si</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, PV, at 3.5 MWp open ground, multi-Si
Electricity from a photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 3.5 MWp and a life time of 30 years installed in 2000 in US and operated by the Tucson Electric Power Company.;
Synonyms: polycrystalline, multi-crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 48d170f2-4335-3203-bf73-c4dd2606438b
Infrastructure for 3.5 MWp PV-plant. Water use for cleaning. Amount of solar energy transformed to electricity. Waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system.
Location: Use in the US.
Technology: Electricity production with grid-connected photovoltaic power plants mounted on open ground.
Time period: Annual yield based on actual annual electricity production of the plant.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Study by Mason et al. 2006 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_48d170f2-4335-3203-bf73-c4dd2606438b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
